  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "Myntra Kotak Credit Card is a co-branded card suitably designed for Myntra loyalists. In addition to providing direct discount on Myntra, the card provides accelerated cashback across other popular brands like Swiggy, Swiggy Instamart, PVR, Cleartrip and Urban Company. Myntra Kotak Credit Card has an edge over other co-branded cards for two key reasons. First, it provides a direct discount at checkout rather than cashback or reward points, keeping the value-back simple for shoppers. Second, the discount rate of 7.5% is notably higher than the typical 5% offered by most cashback or co-branded cards. Though cashback is capped at Rs. 75- per transaction, cardholders can maximize value by splitting their purchases across multiple transactions.",
    "highlights": [
      "Myntra voucher worth Rs. 500 applicable on spending Rs. 500 or more within 30 days of card issuance",
      "Complimentary Myntra Insider membership which entitles users to early access to sales, free shipping on all purchases and exclusive rewards and benefits",
      "Flat 7.5% discount on all Myntra spends"
    ],
    "welcome_benefit": null,
